    "manual_title": "User Manual",
    "manual_intro_title": "Welcome",
    "manual_intro_desc": "Welcome to Oxide Player! It combines local files and YouTube Music in one app, with offline cache, smart recommendations, and a clean player. Feel free to explore—nothing breaks by tapping.",
    "manual_basics_title": "Playing Music",
    "manual_basics_desc": "• **Play/Pause**: Tap the big circle on the player screen.\n• **Next/Previous**: Use the arrows next to the play button.\n• **Seek**: Drag the dot on the progress bar to jump within a song.\n• **Queue**: Open the queue from the player, tap a track to jump, drag to reorder.\n• **Shuffle/Repeat**: Toggle from the player controls.\n• **Mini player**: Keep listening while browsing other screens.\n• **Lyrics**: Tap the lyrics button when available.",
    "manual_library_title": "Your Library",
    "manual_library_desc": "Your local collection lives here.\n\n• **Scan Library**: Find music on your device.\n• **Filters**: Skip too short/long tracks.\n• **Excluded Folders**: Hide folders you don’t want scanned.\n• **Albums/Artists/Folders**: Browse by different views.\n• **Metadata Matching (Beta)**: Auto-fix unknown tags with manual search option.\n• **History / Last Played**: Quickly return to recent tracks.",
    "manual_youtube_title": "YouTube & Online",
    "manual_youtube_desc": "Listen online too.\n\n• **Sign in**: Access personalized recommendations and your library playlists.\n• **Search**: Find songs, albums, and playlists.\n• **Smart Play**: Single tracks play immediately; albums/playlists open a track list.\n• **Queue & Favorites**: Add tracks to the queue or mark as liked.\n• **Download (Cache)**: Save tracks for offline playback (optional Wi‑Fi only).",
    "manual_playlists_title": "Playlists",
    "manual_playlists_desc": "Oxide Player opens YouTube playlists and albums in a track list.\n\n• Tap any track to start from that position.\n• The list becomes your playback queue.\n• Use the queue screen to reorder or jump to a different track.",
    "manual_settings_title": "Settings",
    "manual_settings_desc": "Customize the app and manage data.\n\n• **Appearance**: Theme (light/dark/system), AMOLED, accent color, font size.\n• **Audio**: Equalizer, crossfade, sleep timer.\n• **Library**: Scan, filters, excluded folders, metadata matching.\n• **Cache**: Max size, view cached tracks, clear cache.\n• **Network**: Wi‑Fi‑only downloads.\n• **Backup & Restore**: Save or restore settings.\n• **Logs**: View, share, or send logs (Telegram).",
    "manual_troubleshooting_title": "Troubleshooting",
    "manual_troubleshooting_desc": "• **No music found**: Grant storage permission and run **Scan Library**.\n• **YouTube not loading**: Check internet, sign in again, or refresh cookies.\n• **Downloads fail**: Check Wi‑Fi‑only mode and cache size.\n• **Crashes or playback issues**: Use **Send Logs** in Settings to report.",
